      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>1. In (Your) Name, Merci(ful One)</li>\n<li>What (I) owe him: K\u016blam\u012b f[\u012b]l\u012bs,</li>\n<li>thirty-nine K\u016bla[m\u012b] f\u012bl\u012b(s)</li>\n<li>\\\\against seven and one-half and one-eighth//</li>\n<li>and two fanams. He took possession from this</li>\n<li>of civet worth ten f\u012bl\u012bs.</li>\n<li>He took possession of cinnabar and the copper&nbsp;</li>\n<li>kettle: fifteen f\u012bl\u012bs and&nbsp;</li>\n<li>one and one-half fanam(s). He took possession of glassware:</li>\n<li>one f\u012bl\u012b and one-[fo]urth fanam; two bottles of&nbsp;</li>\n<li>raisins: one-eighth fanam; a lamp:</li>\n<li>one and one-fourth fanam; sugar: one and one-half fanam;</li>\n<li>molasses and sugar: two and one-half and one-fourth fanams;</li>\n<li>a bottle of sugar:</li>\n<li>one f\u012bl\u012b and six fanams. The price of the civet</li>\n<li>remains: 2 f\u012bl\u012bs</li>\n<li>and six fanams. The price of</li>\n<li>two far\u0101silas of myrrh/aromatic resin: one f\u012bl\u012b</li>\n<li>and one fanam. The price of three</li>\n<li>far\u0101silas of storax:</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
